      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:WiLond">Wl Lond</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="3" corresp="#wit-original">7 ic wylle þæt ælc cyld beo his fæder yrfnume æfter his fæder dæge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-original">And it is my will that every child shall be his father's heir after his father's death.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Added October 2026 from Robertson pp. 230–231 (text and translation); Liebermann’s text (K–M) not yet added</note>
